egin="00:08.670" end="00:08.880">why </span><span begin="00:08.880" end="00:08.970">do </span><span begin="00:08.970" end="00:09.120">I </span><span begin="00:09.120" end="00:09.870">overthink </span><span begin="00:09.870" end="00:09.930"> </span><span begin="00:09.930" end="00:11.490">everything</span><span begin="00:11.490" end="00:12.030">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.030" end="00:15.030"><span begin="00:12.030" end="00:12.480">Wonder </span><span begin="00:12.480" end="00:12.660">if </span><span begin="00:12.660" end="00:12.840">she </span><span begin="00:12.840" end="00:13.230">loves </span><span begin="00:13.230" end="00:13.590">me</span><span begin="00:13.590" end="00:13.590">, </span><span begin="00:13.590" end="00:13.920">loves </span><span begin="00:13.920" end="00:14.070">me </span><span begin="00:14.070" end="00:15.030">not</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.030" end="00:17.790"><span begin="00:15.030" end="00:15.750">Overthinkin' </span><span begin="00:15.750" end="00:16.020">us </span><span begin="00:16.020" end="00:16.470">'til </span><span begin="00:16.470" end="00:16.920">after </span><span begin="00:16.920" end="00:17.790">dark</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.790" end="00:21.060"><span begin="00:17.790" end="00:18.120">Baby</span><span begin="00:18.120" end="00:18.120">, </span><span begin="00:18.120" end="00:18.390">go </span><span begin="00:18.390" end="00:18.990">ahead </span><span begin="00:18.990" end="00:19.200">and </span><span begin="00:19.200" end="00:19.470">break </span><span begin="00:19.470" end="00:19.620">my </span><span begin="00:19.620" end="00:20.820">heart</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.060" end="00:23.370"><span begin="00:21.060" end="00:21.330">Now </span><span begin="00:21.330" end="00:21.720">watch </span><span begin="00:21.720" end="00:21.960">me </span><span begin="00:21.960" end="00:22.440">fall </span><span begin="00:22.440" end="00:23.340">apart</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00