n="00:35.850" end="00:35.970">in </span><span begin="00:35.970" end="00:36.120">my </span><span begin="00:36.120" end="00:36.480">hous</span><span begin="00:36.480" end="00:36.510">е </span><span begin="00:36.510" end="00:36.780">for </span><span begin="00:36.780" end="00:36.840">a </span><span begin="00:36.840" end="00:37.500">week</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.590" end="00:40.200"><span begin="00:37.590" end="00:38.040">Tryna </span><span begin="00:38.040" end="00:38.190">be </span><span begin="00:38.190" end="00:38.640">strong </span><span begin="00:38.640" end="00:38.760">but </span><span begin="00:38.760" end="00:38.970">these </span><span begin="00:38.970" end="00:39.330">feelings </span><span begin="00:39.330" end="00:39.510">got </span><span begin="00:39.510" end="00:39.570">m</span><span begin="00:39.570" end="00:39.660">е </span><span begin="00:39.660" end="00:40.140">weak</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.200" end="00:43.380"><span begin="00:40.200" end="00:40.320">I </span><span begin="00:40.320" end="00:40.650">thought </span><span begin="00:40.650" end="00:40.770">I </span><span begin="00:40.770" end="00:41.040">had </span><span begin="00:41.040" end="00:41.190">it </span><span begin="00:41.190" end="00:41.340">in </span><span begin="00:41.340" end="00:41.490">me </span><span begin="00:41.490" end="00:41.670">not </span><span begin="00:41.670" end="00:41.790">to </span><span begin="00:41.790" end="00:42.060">check </span><span begin="00:42.060" end="00:42.210">up </span><span begin="00:42.210" end="00:42.360">on </span><span begin="00:42.360" end="00:42.510">your </span><span begin="00:42.510" end="00:43.350">profile</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.380" end="00:46.170"><span begin="00:43.380" end="00:43.590">But </span><span begin="00:43.590" end="00:43.830">then </span><span begin="00:43.830" end="00:43.890">I </span><span begin="00:43.890" end="00:44.340">scrolled </span><span begin="00:44.340" end="00:46.140">down </span><