><span begin="00:53.640" end="00:54.600">destructive</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.630" end="00:57.210"><span begin="00:54.630" end="00:54.840">My </span><span begin="00:54.840" end="00:55.230">habits </span><span begin="00:55.230" end="00:55.950">toxic</span><span begin="00:55.950" end="00:55.950">, </span><span begin="00:55.950" end="00:56.340">now </span><span begin="00:56.340" end="00:57.000">I</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.210" end="01:00.210"><span begin="00:57.210" end="00:57.600">Wonder </span><span begin="00:57.600" end="00:57.810">if </span><span begin="00:57.810" end="00:58.020">she </span><span begin="00:58.020" end="00:58.410">loves </span><span begin="00:58.410" end="00:58.770">me</span><span begin="00:58.770" end="00:58.770">, </span><span begin="00:58.770" end="00:59.100">loves </span><span begin="00:59.100" end="00:59.250">me </span><span begin="00:59.250" end="01:00.210">not</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.210" end="01:02.910"><span begin="01:00.210" end="01:00.930">Overthinkin' </span><span begin="01:00.930" end="01:01.200">us </span><span begin="01:01.200" end="01:01.680">'til </span><span begin="01:01.680" end="01:02.070">after </span><span begin="01:02.070" end="01:02.880">dark</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.910" end="01:06.240"><span begin="01:02.910" end="01:03.300">Baby</span><span begin="01:03.300" end="01:03.300">, </span><span begin="01:03.300" end="01:03.540">go </span><span begin="01:03.540" end="01:04.170">ahead </span><span begin="01:04.170" end="01:04.380">and </span><span begin="01:04.380" end="01:04.650">break </span><span begin="01:04.650" end="01:04.800">my </span><span begin="01:04.800" end="01:06.030">heart</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.240" end="01:08.520"><span begin="01:06.240" end="01:06.510">Now </span><span begin="01:06.510" end="01:06.870">watch </span><span begin="01:06.870" end="01:07.140">me </span><span begin="01:07.140" end="01:07.590">fall </span><span begin="01:0